          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गति — gati — \"speed (formal); motion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "इस सड़क पर गति सीमा चालीस है। is saṛak par gati sīmā cālīs hai. The speed limit on this road is forty."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गति (gati) is a tatsama, Sanskrit gati, \"going, moving, motion\" (Monier-Williams), kept unchanged; road signs and the news use it: गति सीमा, the speed limit."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
